During Week 6, we focused on developing a prototype video to represent the core concept of the final game.
This stage was crucial for translating design ideas into a tangible visual form. Although the development process was still ongoing, 
we managed to partially implement and visualize the first floor of the game environment. This early build enabled us to demonstrate 
the fundamental structure, character roles, and puzzle mechanics in motion, serving as a foundational step toward 
the complete gameplay experience.
